2026-08-17 -- FULL PROJECT AUDIT: the product's core loop did not exist
================================================================================

METHOD
  Static review of the whole repo + LIVE inspection of the Supabase project
  (icextvgecinmhrhjtfcm) via the PostgREST OpenAPI document and row counts,
  plus a live check of the deployed web build.

HEADLINE FINDING -- grant_matches contained 0 rows
  HomeScreen renders its grant feed from grant_matches. That table was
  empty and NOTHING in the entire codebase ever wrote to it. The n8n
  pipeline only INGESTS grants (grants / grant_chunks); the profile-to-grant
  MATCHING step was never implemented anywhere.
  => Every user saw a permanently empty home screen regardless of how many
     grants were ingested. The "Match Score ranked feed" (phase 1 of the
     product vision) existed on paper only.
  => 24/24 suites and 162/162 tests were green throughout. Code that was
     never written cannot fail a test.

OTHER LIVE FINDINGS
  [CRITICAL] profiles.search_count did NOT exist in production, but
             increment-search-count selects and updates it => the primary
             call to action ("Uj AI Kereses") errored for EVERY free user.
  [CRITICAL] ingest-n8n-grants auth check was corrupted by a secret-masking
             layer into a literal ****** comparison. Reproduced live during
             this session when a newly written comment was also masked.
  [HIGH]     generate-document called the RETIRED gemini-1.5-flash model =>
             the monetised document generation 404'd.
  [HIGH]     chat-with-gemini / generate-action-plan / generate-document were
             deployed at versions OLDER than the 2026-08-15/16 ownership
             security fixes => those fixes protected nothing in production.
  [MEDIUM]   search_frequency existed but nothing read it and no UI set it.
  [MEDIUM]   process-master-document (Gemini OCR) deployed but zero UI called it.
  [MEDIUM]   Several Edge Functions returned raw err.message to clients.

WHY tsc AND jest MISSED IT
  supabase/functions is excluded from tsconfig.json, so 	sc --noEmit never
  looked at the Edge Functions, and Deno tests only covered 2 of them.
  
px deno check is now the required verification for Edge Functions.

WHAT WAS BUILT / FIXED
  supabase/functions/_shared/gemini.ts
      Shared Gemini layer. Embeddings moved to the REST v1beta endpoint
      because the @google/generative-ai SDK does not type
      outputDimensionality -- it only worked by accident and failed
      deno check. Verified empirically to return 768 dims. The helper
      ENFORCES 768 because grant_chunks.embedding is vector(768).
  supabase/functions/_shared/matching.ts
      The matching engine. Two-stage funnel: pgvector similarity over
      match_grant_chunks (widened with still-open grants as a fallback so a
      young DB is not empty), then ONE batched Gemini scoring call (batched
      deliberately: this runs per user on a schedule, on free-tier quota).
  supabase/functions/match-grants/
      User-initiated search. Two-client authorisation: user JWT proves
      ownership, service-role does the writes.
  supabase/functions/scheduled-grant-scan/
      The recurring daily/weekly agent. SCHEDULER_SECRET protected with a
      constant-time compare, FAILS CLOSED when the secret is unset.
  migrations/20260817120000_scheduling_and_matching.sql
      Restores search_count; adds last_scan_at / next_scan_at; UNIQUE index
      on (business_id, grant_id) so repeated scans refresh instead of
      duplicating; adds the missing grant_matches INSERT/DELETE policies;
      trigger guaranteeing a profiles row for every auth user.
  migrations/20260817130000_schedule_grant_scan_cron.sql
      Hourly pg_cron tick. Secret is generated INSIDE the database and kept
      in Supabase Vault, so it never enters git.
  src/screens/SettingsScreen.tsx        daily / weekly / manual cadence
  src/screens/DocumentUploadScreen.tsx  finally uses the OCR function
  src/hooks/useHomeData.ts              search rewired from the n8n webhook
                                        to the real match-grants engine
  All 9 Edge Functions redeployed (the 3 stale security fixes are now live).

